SUMMARY:History\, Lore & Trivia with Adam Zurn and Benton Webbber
DESCRIPTION:Join Historic Rock Ford as we welcome Adam Zurn and Benton Webb
 er for a fun afternoon of "History\, Lore & Trivia" in the Rock Ford Barn.
  First\, Adam Zurn of Uncharted Lancaster will present "Legendary Tales fr
 om the Mighty Susquehanna River." After Adam's presentation\, Benton Webbe
 r will host his "Revolutionary Lancaster Quiz Bowl." Questions and answers
  will be in a Quiz Bowl format with teams of four being created. The Rock 
 Ford barn will be set up so that guests will pick a table to sit at upon a
 rrival for Adam's presentation and then those tables of four will become t
 eams for the Quiz Bowl. Meet up with your friends and make a team or join 
 a group at a table and make some new friends! Adam Zurn's presentation wil
 l be from 2 PM to 3 PM followed by Benton Webber's Quiz Bowl from 3 PM to 
 4 PM. This event will be held in the Langmuir Education Room located on th
 e first floor of the Rock Ford Barn. This event is free but registration i
 s required and seating is limited!\n\nPrice: Not supplied by this calendar
